1
00:00:00,328 --> 00:00:01,368
(Leonard:)No, no. I'm okay.

2
00:00:01,537 --> 00:00:02,957
It stopped bleeding.

3
00:00:03,122 --> 00:00:06,082
Anyway, you did throw up.
Isn't that a sign of a concussion?

4
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,500
Yes, but I get carsick too, so...

5
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,710
(Penny:)Okay.

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,590
(Leonard:)Sorry about your car, by the way.

7
00:00:12,757 --> 00:00:16,387
(Penny:)Oh, no, it's fine.
You got most of it out the window.

8
00:00:16,969 --> 00:00:18,889
(Leonard:)The poor guy on the bike.

9
00:00:21,641 --> 00:00:22,641
(Leonard:)I had a nice time.

10
00:00:23,142 --> 00:00:24,772
(Penny:)Yeah, me too.

11
00:00:25,811 --> 00:00:27,141
Well, um, good night.

12
00:00:27,855 --> 00:00:29,185
(Penny:)Good night.

13
00:00:30,149 --> 00:00:31,819
(Scene:)- Leonard.
- Yeah?

14
00:00:32,568 --> 00:00:34,818
(Penny:)Was this supposed to be a date?

15
00:00:35,655 --> 00:00:37,325
(Leonard:)This?

16
00:00:37,907 --> 00:00:39,907
(Leonard:)No.

17
00:00:40,618 --> 00:00:42,158
(Leonard:)No, of course not.

18
00:00:42,328 --> 00:00:45,578
(Leonard:)This was just you and me hanging out
with guys who didn't show up...

19
00:00:45,748 --> 00:00:48,878
(Leonard:)...because of work and a colonoscopy.

20
00:00:50,169 --> 00:00:51,669
(Penny:)Okay. I was just checking.

21
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:57,300
When I take a girl on a date...
And I do, heh.

22
00:00:58,678 --> 00:01:00,638
(Leonard:)...she knows she's been dated.

23
00:01:02,265 --> 00:01:04,345
Capital D. Heh.

24
00:01:04,767 --> 00:01:09,317
Bold face, underlined, like, dated.

25
00:01:10,273 --> 00:01:13,113
I think I might have a concussion.
I'm gonna go lay down.

26
00:01:13,276 --> 00:01:14,696
(Penny:)Good night.

27
00:01:18,322 --> 00:01:21,662
- So how was your date?
- Awesome. Heh.

28
00:01:25,871 --> 00:01:28,871
Score one for liquor and poor judgment.

